\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab ALL thanks to the Lamb,
\par \pard\li720 His love we proclaim,
\par His praises repeat ;
\par We own Him our Jesus,
\par Continually near
\par To pardon and bless us,
\par And perfect us here.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab In Him we have peace,
\par \pard\li720 In Him we have power,
\par Preserved by His grace
\par Throughout the dark hour,
\par In all our temptation
\par He keeps us to prove
\par His utmost salvation,
\par His fullness of love.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Through pride and desire 
\par \pard\li720 Unhurt we have gone,
\par Through water and fire
\par In Him we went on ;
\par The world and the devil
\par Through Him we o'ercame,
\par Our Saviour from evil,
\par For ever the same.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab O what shall we do
\par \pard\li720 Our Saviour to love ?
\par To make us anew,
\par Come, Lord, from above :
\par The fruit of Thy passion,
\par Thy holiness give,
\par Give us the salvation
\par Of all that believe.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab Pronounce the glad word,
\par \pard\li720 And bid us be free ;
\par Ah ! hast Thou not, Lord,
\par A blessing for me ?
\par The peace Thou hast given
\par This moment impart,
\par And open Thy heaven
\par Of love in m heart.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.\tab Come, Jesus, and loose
\par \pard\li720 The stammerer's tongue,
\par And teach even us 
\par The spiritual song ;
\par Let us without ceasing
\par Give thanks for Thy grace,
\par And glory, and blessing,
\par And honour, and praise.
\par Amen. 
\par \pard 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

